                            origin: .manuscript,
                            speakerID: StoryActorID.neighborStoryteller,
                            attributedActorID: nil,
                            speakerAnnotation: nil,
                            text: "我去集市口说。就一句，莓子没病，我嘴太快。够丢人，大家才肯信。",
