                            speakerID: StoryActorID.ledger,
                            attributedActorID: nil,
                            speakerAnnotation: nil,
                            text: "铃花莓：第一桌投放‘疫斑’，石灯加‘诅咒’。检验拖到第三日，猫店停收三日。",
